    "The income lease is a Serco lease with a 2 month break. The landlord break is 6 months. The MCC break is 28 days. The income hold has no 7 year unbreakable term.",
    "The vacant possession route needs the seller to deliver vacant possession.",
    "Do not proceed at £1,260,000. The screen allows controlled diligence only at or below about £537,000, and only after the seven open hurdles are closed.",
    "This site adds stamp duty on top of the 6.8% purchase costs. The desktop screen may already include stamp duty inside purchase costs.",
    "The yearly Laurito fee is added to running costs, because this model has no separate fee line.",
    "A vacant sale uses one rent path for the return and for interest cover. The desktop screen uses 9 months of rent for the sale and a further 3 month year one void only for interest cover and cash on cash.",
    "The vacant possession price is matched through the sale yield. The model also keeps its purchaser adjustment, so the yield will not stay at the 6% the screen quotes.",
    "Hurdle 14 is a tick on this site until the lease paper is on file. The desktop screen fails the income route because the break is 2 months.",
    "Interest cover stays needs evidence until the fee tick is checked. The desktop screen passes or fails that hurdle on the cover ratio alone."
